---
/**
 * VeteranCareProblem — Section 2
 * "Getting care shouldn't be another battle."
 * Problem narrative: text + image split, closing quote block.
 */
---

<section class="vc-problem" aria-labelledby="vc-problem-heading">
  <div class="vc-problem__inner">

    <!-- Left: editorial copy -->
    <div class="vc-problem__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow vc-problem__eyebrow">The access gap</p>
      <h2 class="vc-problem__heading" id="vc-problem-heading">
        Getting care shouldn't be another battle.
      </h2>

      <p class="vc-problem__lead lead">
        For many veterans, getting referred for treatment is only the beginning.
      </p>

      <div class="vc-problem__body">
        <p>Appointments can take time. Authorizations can run out. Available care may be far from home or work. And treatment can be interrupted even when it is working.</p>
        <p>Meanwhile, the injury doesn't wait.</p>
        <p class="vc-problem__emphasis">Pain continues. Mobility suffers. Progress can be lost.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: photo -->
    <figure class="vc-problem__figure" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- Replace veteran-paperwork.jpg with the paperwork photo once saved to public/images/ -->
      <img
        src="/images/veteran-paperwork.jpg"
        alt=""
        class="vc-problem__photo"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="800"
        height="534"
        onerror="this.src='/images/about-care.jpg'"
      />
    </figure>

  </div>

  <!-- Quote block -->
  <div class="vc-problem__quote-wrap">
    <blockquote class="vc-problem__quote">
      <p class="vc-problem__quote-text">
        "Real veteran quote about waiting, authorization, distance, or interrupted treatment."
      </p>
      <footer class="vc-problem__quote-footer">
        <cite class="vc-problem__quote-cite">— Veteran, 22STRONG program</cite>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>

</section>
